---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Home | AcidMal"
  description="AcidMal is building MomoBot, a Discord bot for moderation and community tools."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="reveal mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300 mb-3">
        Now
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Building MomoBot</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl">
        I'm AcidMal. I make tools for the communities I spend time in. MomoBot is the project on my desk, and it is what I am working on day to day.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-8">
      <section class="pop-card reveal bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg" style="--d: 80ms">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">MomoBot</h2>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-200">
            <span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Active
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
          MomoBot is a Discord bot for moderation and the day-to-day running of a server. One bot covers many servers. Staff keep cases, timed punishments, automod, lockdowns, notes, and reports. Members get welcomes, tickets, verification, levelling, and a private check-in. Each server has its own dashboard, and the colors chosen there are the colors on the embeds the bot posts.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Cases, automod, lockdowns, staff notes, and member reports</li>
          <li>Tickets, verification, welcomes, levelling, stats, and temporary voice rooms</li>
          <li>Alerts when a linked Twitch, YouTube, or Kick channel goes live</li>
          <li>A quiet check-in that can reach someone by direct message, with the sender's name hidden unless they choose to include it</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
          It stores everything in PostgreSQL. Several bot processes share Discord shards, and a separate API serves the dashboard. I run it on Kubernetes.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
          The dashboard is at
          <a href="https://dash.momobot.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">dash.momobot.app</a>.
          Support lives on the
          <a href="https://discord.gg/YHPnuCxTK2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">MomoBot Discord</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pop-card reveal bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg" style="--d: 120ms">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Mail</h2>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-200">
            <span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Active
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
          The mail host at
          <a href="https://mail.acidmal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">mail.acidmal.com</a>
          is still running. It is a self-hosted
          <a href="https://mailcow.email/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">Mailcow</a>
          server I stood up in 2025, and it is the inbox I use now.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pop-card reveal bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg" style="--d: 140ms">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">The past year</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          This past year I started MomoBot, and I am still building it. This month I also put up a site for VANTA Automotive Collective.
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-6">
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 40ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">November 2026 · ongoing</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">MomoBot, still the main project</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              Creator alerts for Twitch, YouTube, and Kick. Levelling, server stats, and voice channels that appear when someone joins a lobby and disappear when the room empties. This month I added the check-in command: a private message, a prepared note or one you write, and a way for the recipient to ask for a review if it did not feel okay.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 90ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">November 2026</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">VANTA Automotive Collective</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              A pre-launch website and staff portal for a Central Queensland automotive collective. Public pages, accounts, an enquiry inbox, and editors for site copy and giveaway drafts. Membership checkout and prize draws are not switched on. The site is
              <a href="https://www.vantacollective.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">vantacollective.com.au</a>.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 140ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">October 2026</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">MomoBot, first version</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              I started the bot in October. The first cut covered slash-command moderation, automod, tickets, verification, logging, per-server themes, and the dashboard. Shard leasing and the Kubernetes deploy landed in the same stretch, including a Google Kubernetes Engine setup so the gateway, API, and dashboard can run separately.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="pop-card reveal bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg" style="--d: 180ms">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Earlier</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Before this past year I was already putting servers and bots online. These are the ones that stuck around long enough to remember.
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-6">
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 40ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">2025</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">This site</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              I built this site in Astro.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 90ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">Late 2024 – early 2025</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">Minecraft server</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              A modded server on All the Mods 10, run with
              <a href="https://mynameistito.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">Tito</a>
              and people from the
              <a href="https://discord.gg/kzg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">KZG</a>
              community. It is offline. A few screenshots are still in the
              <a href="/gallary/minecraft" class="site-link">gallery</a>.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal relative border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-4" style="--d: 140ms">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-500 dark:text-purple-300">2022–2023</p>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1 mb-2">Anagram</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              A Discord bot I ran on
              <a href="https://github.com/Cog-Creators/Red-DiscordBot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-link">Red</a>.
              It reached more than 100 servers and covered music and moderation. I did not build all of it myself. Bugs at the time were enough that I stopped maintaining it.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .site-link {
    @apply text-purple-400 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-purple-600 dark:hover:text-purple-300;
  }
</style>
